# motion-switch (plan section 6, M10): FV 05's function switch, x² → sin x. The picker's sin x option
# (343.75, 164, 97.25 x 34 at 1440 x 900 in the reference's DOM: its centre (392, 181)) clicked: the
# old curve fades over 160 ms while the new one draws on over 900 ms (cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1):
# 0, 3, 15, 50, 85, 100 %), each mark landing on the enter spring as the pen passes its x (P at x = 2,
# the anchor at 0, the grip at 1). The frames at the filmstrip's 0, 160, 300, 450, 600 and 900 ms
# (on the 16 ms grid: 288 and 448 for 300 and 450), then at rest; the pointer then leaves for the
# top bar.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 392 181
shot switch-0000
wait 160
shot switch-0160
wait 140
shot switch-0300
wait 150
shot switch-0450
wait 150
shot switch-0600
wait 300
shot switch-0900
wait 300
shot switch-rest
